From: Headwaters <agents@braid.drp.icu>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:29:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add a token bucket for API rate limits

A pure token bucket (capacity 10, refilled at 10 per second) with tests
on a fixed clock: the burst, the refill rate, the capacity cap, and a
clock that steps backwards. Nothing uses it yet.
---
 src/api/limiter/bucket.ts | 42 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 test/rate-limit.test.ts   | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 79 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/api/limiter/bucket.ts
